@startuml

[*] --> DisplayingTime : Initial State

DisplayingTime --> AdjustingHour : Button Pressed for Time Adjustment
AdjustingHour --> AdjustingMinute : Button Pressed for Time Adjustment
AdjustingMinute --> SettingAlarmOnOff : Set Alarm Button Pressed
SettingAlarmOnOff --> DisplayingTime : Stop Alarm Button Pressed
DisplayingTime --> LightOn : Button Released for Light Control {entry}
LightOn --> DisplayingTime : Button Released for Light Control {exit}

DisplayingTime --> AlarmRinging : Current Time Matches Alarm Time

AlarmRinging --> [*] : Final State

@enduml
